mapper.select:
SELECT OutAmt.코드 As code, OutAmt.그룹코드 As GroupCode, OutAmt.날짜 as date, OutAmt.금액 as amt, OutAmt.비고 as cnte, OutAmt.계정코드1 as code1, OutAmt.계정코드2 as code2, OutAmt.계정코드3 as code3, OutAmt.코드분류 As codeGb, CoutConf1.관 As cdNm1, CoutConf2.항 As cdNm2, CoutConf3.목 As cdNm3, OutAmt.년도 As year, OutAmt.성도코드1 As patNo1, OutAmt.이름1 As patName1, OutAmt.성도코드2 As patNo2, OutAmt.이름2 As patName2, OutAmt.성도코드3 As patNo3, OutAmt.이름3 As patName3, OutAmt.WorkCd As workCd, OutAmt.UER_YN As uerYn FROM 지출_Befo OutAmt left outer join 지출관 CoutConf1 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf1.관코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf1.코드분류 left outer join 지출항 CoutConf2 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf2.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf2.항코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf2.코드분류 left outer join 지출목 CoutConf3 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf3.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf3.항코드 and OutAmt.계정코드3 = CoutConf3.목코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf3.코드분류 WHERE 1 = 1
AND OutAmt.UER_YN = #{uerYn}
AND OutAmt.코드분류 = #{codeGb}
AND OutAmt.년도 = #{year}
AND OutAmt.코드 = #{code}
AND OutAmt.코드 = (Select Max(코드) From 지출_Befo)

SELECT OutAmt.코드 As code, OutAmt.그룹코드 As GroupCode, OutAmt.날짜 as date, OutAmt.금액 as amt, OutAmt.비고 as cnte, OutAmt.계정코드1 as code1, OutAmt.계정코드2 as code2, OutAmt.계정코드3 as code3, OutAmt.코드분류 As codeGb, CoutConf1.관 As cdNm1, CoutConf2.항 As cdNm2, CoutConf3.목 As cdNm3, OutAmt.년도 As year, OutAmt.성도코드1 As patNo1, OutAmt.이름1 As patName1, OutAmt.성도코드2 As patNo2, OutAmt.이름2 As patName2, OutAmt.성도코드3 As patNo3, OutAmt.이름3 As patName3, OutAmt.WorkCd As workCd, OutAmt.UER_YN As uerYn FROM 지출_Befo OutAmt left outer join 지출관 CoutConf1 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf1.관코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf1.코드분류 left outer join 지출항 CoutConf2 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf2.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf2.항코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf2.코드분류 left outer join 지출목 CoutConf3 on OutAmt.계정코드1 = CoutConf3.관코드 and OutAmt.계정코드2 = CoutConf3.항코드 and OutAmt.계정코드3 = CoutConf3.목코드 and OutAmt.코드분류 = CoutConf3.코드분류 WHERE 1 = 1
AND OutAmt.UER_YN = #{uerYn}
AND OutAmt.WorkCd = #{workCd}
AND OutAmt.코드분류 = #{codeGb}
AND OutAmt.그룹코드 = #{GroupCode}
AND OutAmt.년도 = #{year}
AND OutAmt.날짜 >= #{fmDate}
AND OutAmt.날짜 <= #{toDate}
order by OutAmt.날짜 desc, OutAmt.코드 desc
